abstract: >-
  Java-based command-line tool for generating and validating static
  IIIF images, with pluggable sources/sinks for UltraHDR gain-map
  tiling, C2PA-signed tiles and JPEG XL input.
keywords:
  - IIIF
  - tiling
  - image processing
  - UltraHDR
  - HDR
  - C2PA
